  "name": "breakout-coordinator",
  "description": "Start a small team of AI agents from the Claude Code or Codex conversation you're in. They discuss a question, design or document, and the reviewed answer comes back to that same conversation. Agents can be Claude, Codex or OpenAI-compatible API models, and they only discuss: they can't run commands or edit your files.",
